    <tag k="classification" v="Infrastructure"/>
    <tag k="description" v="28ft. Sculpture comprised of two conical forms, one suspended directly above the other so that the point of the hanging cone and that of the standing cone almost touch each other. The bronze cone is fabricated so that it responds to air current and vibrat"/>
    <tag k="location" v="Seattle Justice Center, Seattle Municipal Court Lobby"/>
    <tag k="measurements" v="28' x 3' x 3' Sculpture 29' x 18' curved wall"/>
